From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath5k: disable fast channel changes

Use a full hardware reset for channel changes instead of the fast
channel-change path.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath5k/reset.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath5k/reset.c
@@ -1154,6 +1154,7 @@ ath5k_hw_reset(struct ath5k_hw *ah, enum
 	tsf_lo = 0;
 	mode = 0;
 
+#if 0
 	/*
 	 * Sanity check for fast flag
 	 * Fast channel change only available
@@ -1161,6 +1162,7 @@ ath5k_hw_reset(struct ath5k_hw *ah, enum
 	 */
 	if (fast && (ah->ah_radio != AR5K_RF2413) &&
 	(ah->ah_radio != AR5K_RF5413))
+#endif
 		fast = false;
 
 	/* Disable sleep clock operation
